WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
 

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.400
ROBERTS: This is a story of
an unlikely friendship that

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:04.037
transformed America forever.

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:15.749
(theme music plays)

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:20.153
<i> ♪ Wade in the water ♪</i>

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.789
<i> ♪ Wade in the water ♪</i>

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:25.291
<i> ♪ Wade in the water ♪</i>

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:28.227 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> ♪ God's gonna
