00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.603
<i> ♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh ♪</i>

00:09:30.903 --> 00:09:32.972
<i> ♪ Oh, oh, oh ♪</i>

00:09:33.605 --> 00:09:35.575
<i> ♪ Oh, oh, oh ♪</i>

